coration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.23vyxp8alqac" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">10. Testing Standards</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Every meaningful change MUST have an appropriate verification strategy using applicable test categories:</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><ul class="lst-kix_5v7lvoxuq2uf-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Unit tests:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Test individual functions, classes, and transformations.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Integration tests:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Test communication between Kernel stages and external boundaries.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Regression tests:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Reproduce previously discovered bugs and confirm existing behavior remains intact.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">Security tests:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Verify input validation, permission enforcement, and failure isolation.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Tests MUST NOT depend on live external services unless explicitly designed as integration or end-to-end tests. Do not weaken or delete existing tests simply because the implementation fails them.</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.llzjne90rfh9" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">11. API and Interface Contracts</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_5v7lvoxuq2uf-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Define accepted inputs and returned outputs for API endpoints and service boundaries.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Validate request data, use appropriate HTTP status codes, and return structured error responses.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Avoid leaking internal implementation details.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Maintain compatibility unless a breaking change has been explicitly approved.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">For the existing FastAPI prototype, follow established route, schema, dependency-injection, and error-handling patterns.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.odat8th141w6" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">12. AI and Reasoning Components</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_5v7lvoxuq2uf-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Separate model-provider integration from core application logic.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Validate model outputs before passing them to downstream components.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Handle timeouts, rate limits, malformed responses, and provider failures.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Do not treat generated text as executable instructions by default.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Do not allow a model to bypass permission checks or commit policies.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Preserve the distinction between a generated proposal and an executed action.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">The deterministic reasoning implementation remains the baseline until an AI adapter is explicitly implemented and tested.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.likwyzf9hbb" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">13. Privacy and Local-First Readiness</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_5v7lvoxuq2uf-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Avoid unnecessary dependence on external services.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Keep provider and storage integrations replaceable through explicit interfaces.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Minimize collection and retention of personal data.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Make persistence behavior explicit and avoid unnecessary transmission of private user information.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.vplgewufhob3" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">14. Documentation and Code Comments</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_5v7lvoxuq2uf-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Documentation must explain important decisions, contracts, setup steps, and non-obvious behavior.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span>Comments should explain </span><span style="font-style:italic">why</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;a decision exists, not merely repeat what the code says.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Mark provisional designs, assumptions, unresolved questions, and future intentions clearly.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.dzxw4tot6sps" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">15. Formatting and Static Quality</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_5v7lvoxuq2uf-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Follow formatters, linters, type checkers, and test tools already configured in the repository (e.g., PEP 8 for Python).</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Use consistent formatting and imports; avoid unused imports, dead code, and unexplained magic values.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.31bzehuaj70x" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color: